<p>
  {dgettext("help_commands", "Stops keeping a message in view.")}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_question}>{dgettext("help_commands", "When to Use It")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Use it when a pinned message is out of date, such as old rules or an event that is over. It also frees a place, because a channel keeps at most 50 pinned messages."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_code}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Syntax")}</.help_h4>
<pre>{dgettext("help_commands", "/unpin <message id>")}</pre>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tag}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Parameters")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <code>message id</code>
  {dgettext("help_commands", "— The number of a message this channel is keeping.")}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_commands", "How It Works")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "The message itself stays exactly where it is in the conversation — only the pin goes. The Pinned window unpins from the entry too, which is usually where you are when you decide to."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Easier than the id: right-click a pinned message and choose Unpin. That menu item appears only for channel operators and owners. After an unpin, the pinned count of the channel updates for everyone in it."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lock}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Who can")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Channel operators and owners, the same as pinning. Unpinning a message nothing was keeping is not an error, and it changes nothing."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "When the message was not pinned, the reply is the same confirmation as a real unpin."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Rules & Limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>{dgettext("help_commands", "Half-operators cannot unpin messages")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_commands",
      "You must type it in a channel window, not in a private conversation"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_commands",
      "The id must be a whole number greater than zero. Anything else gets an error that it is not a message id."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_commands", "Without an id, you get a hint to use the Pinned window instead")}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Examples")}</.help_h4>
<pre>{dgettext("help_commands", "/unpin 1284")}</pre>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_commands", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="cmd-pin">{dgettext("help_commands", "/pin")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="ui-pinned-window">{dgettext("help_commands", "Pinned Window")}</.help_link>
</p>
